LR81. REMOVAL
Notices for removal shall have attached only the following documents:
1. All executed process in the case;
2. Pleadings asserting causes of action, e.g., petitions, counterclaims, cross 
actions, third-party actions, interventions and all answers to such 
pleadings;
3. All orders signed by the state judge;
4. The docket sheet;
5. An index of matters being filed; and
6. A list of all counsel of record, including addresses, telephone numbers, 
email addresses and parties represented.
